  "notes": "All 31 screen identifiers and names were verified from the approved interactive Claude Design source. The source references ./support.js, which is not present in the repository; the local renderer's Claude Design adapter supplies the required render-only runtime without modifying the source. No additional local design source file is directly required. Routes and per-screen phase labels remain unset because the source does not define them using the manifest vocabulary. Owner visual approval recorded 2026-10-06, bound to the source bytes in provenance.json (approval.boundTo). It approves the visual design only; it does not approve any business, API, data, security or hardware decision, and the prototype logic inside the mockup (cart arithmetic, rounding, change, held sales, tender simulation) is demonstration only."
